"<https://www.nbb.be/doc/ba/models/social%20balance/avis_cnc_2009_12.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"**Empfehlung CBN 2009/12**: `Le bilan social et les travailleurs statutaires "
"<https://www.nbb.be/doc/ba/models/social%20balance/avis_cnc_2009_12.pdf>`_ "
