"Registerkarte :guilabel:`Gehaltseingaben` hinzugefügt werden können:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Back Pay`: Additional salary payout can be included under this "
