"The *Worked Days* tab lists the number of days and hours the employee worked "
"during the :guilabel:`Period` specified at the top portion of the payslip "
"form. This tab is automatically populated with all the individual attendance "
"records for the time period, including both worked time and any time off "
"taken."
msgstr ""

